WEBVTT

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.736
to see ourselves as safe,

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.280
to keep ourselves over here.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:08.496
We speak well, we dress decent,

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:12.440
we're intelligent, people like us,
or act like they do.

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:17.720
But instead, I say that we
should remember Lot's wife.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:22.376
Jesus of Nazareth said it
first to his disciples:

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.840
"Remember Lot's wife."

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:29.616
Lot, in case you haven't
read the Bible recently,

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.896
was a man who set
his family down in Sodom,